// Bring-up model (throwaway / run_class:smoke). The REAL semantic layer is
// produced by the model-authored `layer-build` pass — do not treat this as the
// experiment's layer. One entity, minimal measures, no joins (per Lloyd's
// source-per-entity convention).
source: payments_base is duckdb.table('payments') extend {
  measure:
    transaction_count is count()
    total_eur is eur_amount.sum()
}
